Title: F1: The Movie's Callie Cooke did real British Grand Prix pit stop
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': "Because of the Northamptonshire-Silverstone connection, it feels so special and so real, it's just been the coolest thing.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 48, 'EndChar': 133}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': 'Pitt loved working in Northamptonshire and Silverstone.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 10, 'EndChar': 58}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': 'It was our home for at least a year. We were pretty much living there.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 66, 'EndChar': 128}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': '[Pitt] loved it and he loved the crew and he has such a British sense of humour.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 1, 'EndChar': 76}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': 'I spent the day there and I was changing the tyres and I was changing the oil, changing the wing of the car, and just seeing if I could exist in the world of a garage.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 10, 'EndChar': 159}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': 'I think it did kind of help growing up in Northampton and not far from Silverstone because I do know a lot of people that work with cars, and I just got stuck in that garage.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 9, 'EndChar': 170}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': "I knew that if I was going to play a woman in this male-dominated industry, I was just going to have to hold my own and get stuck in, and I think maybe that's how I got the job.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 13, 'StartChar': 9, 'EndChar': 158}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': 'We did a real pit stop in between Mercedes and Ferrari, and we did it as quick as the other teams.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 39, 'EndChar': 122}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': "It was just mad. I don't know how they ever let us get away with it, to be honest.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 1, 'EndChar': 83}}, {'Speaker': 'Callie Cooke', 'Text': 'It was one of the best experiences of my life.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 18, 'StartChar': 1, 'EndChar': 43}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'One of the stars of F1: The Movie said it was "mad" she got to perform a real pit stop during last year\'s British Grand Prix.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 97}}, {'Description': 'Cooke then trained to be part of the team and said she was "the only actor in the pit crew and all of the other guys were mechanics or engineers or worked in motor sports or stunt guys".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 155}}, {'Description': 'Cooke said working in and around real F1 teams and at real grand prix races was a "once-in-a-lifetime experience" for the cast and crew.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 110}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A selfie photo by Callie Cooke with her smiling alongside Simone Ashley wearing red, Joseph Kosinski in black and Damson Idris in a white motor-racing suit. They are in the pit lane at Silverstone while people work behind them.'}]}
